*.miz
/missions/
*.miz.bak

# Backups the mission-editing tools (MCP) take before every write, and the presets report of each build
/.veaf-backups/
/presets-validation-report.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Mission de test locale (tools/make_test_mission.py), cache des tuiles OpenStreetMap, journaux de build, Python local
/bridge/
/tools/*.log
/tools/tiles/
/tools/.py
__pycache__/
/tools/probe_chunks.json
